0,Melanau language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melanau_language,"Melanau is an Austronesian language spoken in the coastal area of the Rajang delta on northwest Borneo, Sarawak, Malaysia and Brunei. There are several dialects—Mukah-Oya, Balingian, Bruit, Dalat, Lawas, Igan, Sarikei, Segahan, Prehan, Segalang, and Siteng.","Melanau, Sibu",Austronesian
