5,Sibu sets Malaysia record with 18.3m Melanau swing at ...,https://newswav.com/article/sibu-sets-malaysia-record-with-18-3m-melanau-swing-at-cultural-fest-A2507_mnvXNJ,"Jul 13, 2025 · SIBU: The Sibu Municipal Council (SMC) has secured a spot in the Malaysia Book of Records (MBOR) with its towering 18.3-metre Melanau swing, known as the itut. Built as the centrepiece of this year’s Borneo Cultural Festival (BCF), the swing became a major attraction, drawing 2,288 visitors, surpassing the initial target of 2,000.","Melanau, Sibu",Austronesian
